      "content": "that’s a good start. it definitely has the vibe. for the next part of the monologue, i want to get into the specifics. can you write a section where the host calls out the specific ways the \"elites\" and the big corporations are essentially cheating the working man? like, talk about how the policies being passed are clearly designed to help the 1% while everyone else struggles with inflation and stagnant wages. make it sound like it’s just an obvious fact that the system is broken on purpose.",
